        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jang Hoon, Kim Ki-duk, Juhn Jai-hong, Song Kang-ho, Thomas Kretschmann\n- Films: Rough Cut, Secret Reunion, The Front Line, A Taxi Driver, Beautiful, Poongsan\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Ki-duk gave scripts to former assistant director Juhn Jai-hong for the films \"Beautiful\" and \"Poongsan.\"\n- Kim Ki-duk gave a script to former assistant director Jang Hoon for the film \"Rough Cut.\"\n- Jang Hoon directed \"Rough Cut\" in 2008.\n- Jang Hoon directed \"Secret Reunion\" in 2010.\n- Jang Hoon directed \"The Front Line\" in 2011.\n- Jang Hoon directed the 2017 South Korean historical action drama film \"A Taxi Driver.\"\n- \"A Taxi Driver\" stars Song Kang-ho in the title role alongside Thomas Kretschmann.",
